The redesign had to bring two car brands together, so the site’s previous look was updated to suit both Volvo and Polestar.

I had built the original UI library in Figma using variables for colors and fonts, and well-structured components, so integrating the visual guidelines from the advertising agency into the existing library took very little time.

I have built numerous UI libraries from scratch and have also adapted and made use of existing ones. This work benefits designers and developers alike, and I have received praise for my thorough, well-functioning design libraries.
